 Italy, and eat tacos in Mexico.  I miss my friends already. We spend a lot of time together. I need to keep in touch with them by e-mail and text.", "id": 2, "time": "21700", "image": "engenn3le08ob04re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "There is also Meenee, my cat. It is my friend Peter's turn to  look after him. He is picking him up tomorrow.", "id": 3, "time": "37700", "image": "engenn3le08ob04re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "My next blog is from Paris. Wish me luck!", "id": 4, "time": "47000", "image": "engenn3le08ob04re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn3le08ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le08ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}